{"id": "d002-001", "text": "Coffee with Eilidh. Her dad's hip op is booked for May 14 and she's taking the week off to look after him. She's pretty anxious about it tbh. Text her the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d002-002", "text": "Long call with Anders. He got made redundant on Friday, whole team cut. Seems weirdly upbeat, already talking about retraining as an electrician. His wife Marisol is back at work full time now so money's ok for a bit. He's got a meeting with a careers advisor on May 9 and an open day at the college sometime in early June. Remind me to ask Anders how the open day goes, and send him that apprenticeship link.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly upbeat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "retraining as an electrician", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "back at work full time", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting with a careers advisor", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 9", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "open day at the college", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early June", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Anders how the open day goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that apprenticeship link", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "d002-004", "text": "Lunch w Pooja and Kavya. Pooja's leaving drinks are June 3rd, she's off to a startup in Leeds. Kavya got promoted to team lead last month and is already shattered. I'm bringing the cake for Pooja's do.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to a startup in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promoted to team lead", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pooja", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "d002-009", "text": "Quick catch up with Julien after 5 a side. New job at the hospital trust in finance, starts Oct 3rd. His partner Tanvi is expecting in the spring as well so big year for them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after 5 a side"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "New job at the hospital trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in finance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tanvi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "d002-011", "text": "Called Barbara. Her knee replacement got postponed again, now maybe end of November. She's fed up and in a lot of pain. I should ring her again Thursday. Her daughter Amy is trying to get her seen privately but the waiting list there is three months too. Barbara's still insisting on doing her own shopping, stubborn as ever. Maybe offer to take her to the big Tesco on Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee replacement", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe end of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a lot of pain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her again", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "three months"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "insisting on doing her own shopping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "stubborn", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to take her to the big Tesco", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "d002-012", "text": "Ebony's first week as a paramedic. She says the night shifts are brutal but she loves it. Her boyfriend Cem has been doing all the cooking. She's vegan now btw, remember for dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first week as a paramedic", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "night shifts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "d002-016", "text": "Aneesh had his scan results back, all clear. He'd been worrying about it for weeks. Celebrating with a curry Saturday, I'm going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "weeks"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Celebrating with a curry", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "d002-019", "text": "Abebe is in hospital with pneumonia, admitted Tuesday. His wife says he should be out sometime next week if the antibiotics work. Remind me to text her for an update on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital with pneumonia", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "admitted", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her for an update", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d002-020", "text": "Talked to Marisol about her new job at the vet practice. Loves it, much better than the call centre. Her dog Pepper gets to come in on Saturdays. She hates the early starts though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "job at the vet practice", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Loves it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturdays"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates the early starts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "d002-022", "text": "Drinks with Finn, Noah and Eilidh. Finn's been offered a job in Berlin, deciding by the end of the month. Noah thinks he should go. Eilidh just finished her nursing course and starts on the wards in early March. Need to get Eilidh a little something for passing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a job in Berlin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "deciding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursing course", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts on the wards", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get Eilidh a little something for passing", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "d002-026", "text": "Delroy's wife Jasmine had a fall and broke her wrist last week. Surgery was Monday, she's in a cast now. Delroy is doing all the driving. Should pop round with dinner sometime this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke her wrist", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Surgery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round with dinner", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d002-027", "text": "Zoe's leaving the agency, last day June 20th. Going freelance. She's nervous about money but excited. Her husband Patrick is fully behind it. Ask her if she wants intros to anyone.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the agency", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 20th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Going freelance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about money", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her if she wants intros to anyone", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "d002-031", "text": "Akira didn't get the senior role. He's gutted. Still at the old place for now. Remind me to take him for a pint next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "didn't get the senior role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the old place", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d002-032", "text": "Aleksander has started at the warehouse, nights. Says it's fine, the money is good. Still not over Magda I think. He's into climbing again which is good.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleksander", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the warehouse, nights", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not over", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d002-033", "text": "Marisol's mum had a stroke last weekend. Stable now, in the stroke unit at St Mary's. Marisol is going every day after work and looks exhausted. Her brother Tomás is flying in on May 2nd and staying till mid May. Doctors are saying rehab could take most of the summer. Marisol's worried about her job too, she only started at the vet practice in March. Need to send her a message tonight and offer to walk Pepper for her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stroke", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in the stroke unit", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every day after work"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "till mid May", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rehab", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "most of the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about her job", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at the vet practice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d7", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to walk Pepper for her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "d002-037", "text": "Cem got made redundant from the bank today. Third round of cuts this year. He's furious more than sad. His redundancy meeting with HR is May 21, wants advice on the package. I said I'd look over it with him. His partner Vanessa is on maternity leave so the timing is awful, baby's only 4 months. He's thinking of going contract, maybe something sorted by end of the summer. Ask Cem how the HR meeting went on the 21st.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant from the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this year"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "furious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy meeting with HR", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 21", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "on maternity leave", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "only 4 months", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going contract", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of the summer", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Cem how the HR meeting went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 21st", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d002-040", "text": "Vanessa and her husband are moving to Portugal over the summer now he's retired. Selling the house end of June. She's sad about leaving the grandkids.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vanessa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Portugal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "retired", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Selling the house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of June", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandkids", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "d002-041", "text": "Finn's going to Berlin! Accepted the offer, starts July 7th. Leaving do is sometime late June. His girlfriend Amy is staying here for now, long distance. Remind me to get him a going away present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Berlin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offer", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 7th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime late June", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "long distance", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him a going away present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "d002-042", "text": "Kavya said her promotion party got cancelled because half the team has covid. Rescheduling maybe early next month. She's had a cough all week too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe early next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cough", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "d002-043", "text": "Spoke to Efua, she's back at work after the op and feeling much better. Her new manager Delroy is apparently great. Her son starts secondary in September and he's dreading it, all his mates are going to a different school. She's taking him to the open evening on June 12. Efua also mentioned she's started running again, 5k on Saturdays at the park, slowly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "much better", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "open evening", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 12", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturdays"}]}
{"id": "d002-045", "text": "Julien's dad passed in the summer and he's only now talking about it. Struggling more than he lets on. His sister Magda handles most of the estate stuff. Should check in with Julien more often, maybe every couple of weeks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Julien more often", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "maybe every couple of weeks", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d002-047", "text": "Tomás had his hernia op cancelled on the day, no beds. Rebooked for 11/3 apparently. Elif's furious on his behalf. Ask Tomás if the new date holds.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hernia op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/3", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "furious on his behalf", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Tomás if the new date holds", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "d002-048", "text": "Catch up with Eilidh, Divya and Jasmine at brunch. Eilidh's dad is home after the hip op and doing well, walking with a frame. Divya is settling in at the firm and has her first review on July 18. Jasmine and her partner just got a rescue greyhound called Rocket. All good news for once. Should organise another brunch end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "walking with a frame", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first review", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 18", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jasmine", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "rescue greyhound called Rocket", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "organise another brunch", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "d002-049", "text": "Ayo's back from Lagos after the funeral. Says the family is holding up. He's back at work on Monday but taking it slow. Remind me to check how he's doing at the end of the week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Lagos", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "holding up", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how he's doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
